4em 0.6em}.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable td,.mw-parser-output .infobox.geography .maptable th{border:0;padding:0}</style><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"border-spacing:3px; width:30em;\"><caption class=\"\" style=\"font-size: 125%; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></caption><tbody><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fotbollss%C3%A4song\" title=\"Fotbollssäsong\">Säsong</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\">2019</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\">Nya lag för säsongen</span></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka DFF</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">KIF Örebro</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Vinnare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Nedflyttade</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/IF_Limhamn_Bunkeflo_(damer)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IF Limhamn Bunkeflo (damer)\">Limhamn Bunkeflo</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka DFF</a></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2020/2021\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2020/2021\">Champions League</a></th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC</a></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;background-color:#f0f1f2;\">Statistik</th></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Bästa målgörare</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Anna_Anveg%C3%A5rd\" title=\"Anna Anvegård\">Anna Anvegård</a> (14 mål)</td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;hemmavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kopparbergs/G%C3%B6teborg_FC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kopparbergs/Göteborg FC\">Göteborg</a> 6–0 <a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(10 augusti 2019)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Största&#160;bortavinst</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka</a> 0–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstads_DFF\" title=\"Kristianstads DFF\">Kristianstad</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(20 juli 2019)</span></td></tr><tr><th style=\"text-align:left; width:35%; text-align:left; vertical-align:top;\">Målrikaste match</th><td class=\"\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4xj%C3%B6_DFF\" title=\"Växjö DFF\">Växjö</a> 5–5 <a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka</a><br /><span style=\"font-size:smaller; line-height:130%\">(23 september 2019)</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"\"><div style=\"float: left;\">&#8592; <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2018\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2018\">2018</a> </div><div style=\"float: right;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2020\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2020\">2020</a> &#8594;</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><b>Damallsvenskan 2019</b> var <a href=\"/wiki/Sverige\" title=\"Sverige\">Sveriges</a> högsta division i fotboll för damer under säsongen 2019. Nya lag för säsongen var <a href=\"/wiki/Kungsbacka_DFF\" title=\"Kungsbacka DFF\">Kungsbacka DFF</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> och <a href=\"/wiki/KIF_%C3%96rebro_DFF\" title=\"KIF Örebro DFF\">KIF Örebro</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/FC_Roseng%C3%A5rd_(damfotboll)\" title=\"FC Rosengård (damfotboll)\">FC Rosengård</a> tog hem sin elfte <a href=\"/wiki/Svenska_m%C3%A4stare_i_fotboll#Damer\" title=\"Svenska mästare i fotboll\">SM-titel</a> och sin första sedan <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan_2015\" title=\"Damallsvenskan 2015\">2015</a>.\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Tabeller\">Tabeller</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Tabeller\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Tabeller\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Poängtabell\"><span id=\"Po.C3.A4ngtabell\"></span>Poängtabell</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitt: Poängtabell\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>redigera</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Redigera avsnitts källkod: Poängtabell\"><span>redigera wikitext</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"infobox wikitable\" style=\"font-size:85%;width:22em;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ffec8b;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Mästare samt kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2020/2021\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2020/2021\">Champions League 2020/2021</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#c3c3dc;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Kvalificerad för <a href=\"/wiki/Uefa_Women%27s_Champions_League_2020/2021\" title=\"Uefa Women&#39;s Champions League 2020/2021\">Champions League 2020/2021</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#f0c4c4;\">&#8195;</td>\n<td>Nedflyttning till <a href=\"/wiki/Elitettan_2020\" title=\"Elitettan 2020\">Elitettan 2020</a>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&#160;<span class=\"noprint plainlinks\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:normal; font-size:80%; ;\">Denna tabell:&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2019\" title=\"Mall:Poängtabell för Damallsvenskan 2019\"><span title=\"Visa denna mall\" style=\";\">visa</span></a>&#160;<span style=\"font-size:80%;\">•</span>&#160;<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://sv.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Mall:Po%C3%A4ngtabell_f%C3%B6r_Damallsvenskan_2019&amp;action=edit\"><span style=\";\" title=\"Redigera den här mallen\">redigera</span></a></span>&#160;\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"font-size:0.9375em;line-height:1.4em;text-align:center;background:white;margin-top:0.1em;\">\n<tbody><tr><th style=\"width:1.8em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help;\" title=\"Placering\">Nr</span> </th>\n<th style=\"width: 13em;\"> Lag </th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <span style=\"cursor:help; border-bottom:1px dotted;\" title=\"Spelade matcher\">S</span></th>\n<th style=\"width: 2em;\"> <spa