alland.se/kungsbacka-dff-klara-for-allsvenskan/\">https://norrahalland.se/kungsbacka-dff-klara-for-allsvenskan/</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 19 november 2018</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=Kungsbacka+DFF+klara+f%C3%B6r+Allsvenskan&amp;rft.jtitle=Norra+Hallands+veckoblad&amp;rft.aulast=Christian+Johansson&amp;rft.au=Christian+Johansson&amp;rft.date=13+oktober+2018&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fnorrahalland.se%2Fkungsbacka-dff-klara-for-allsvenskan%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info:sid/en.wikipedia.org:Damallsvenskan&#95;2019\"><span style=\"display: none;\">&#160;</span></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r58662249\" /><cite style=\"font-style:normal\" class=\"news\" id=\"CITEREFJonathan&#95;Nilsson2018\">Jonathan Nilsson&#32;(28 oktober 2018).&#32;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.aftonbladet.se/sportbladet/fotboll/a/P3J2x6/antligen-gick-det-vagen\">””Äntligen gick det vägen””</a>&#32;(på svenska).&#32;<i><a href=\"/wiki/Aftonbladet\" title=\"Aftonbladet\">Aftonbladet</a></i><span class=\"printonly\">. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.aftonbladet.se/sportbladet/fotboll/a/P3J2x6/antligen-gick-det-vagen\">https://www.aftonbladet.se/sportbladet/fotboll/a/P3J2x6/antligen-gick-det-vagen</a></span><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">.&#32;Läst 14 mars 2019</span>.</cite><span class=\"Z3988\" title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.atitle=%E2%80%9D%C3%84ntligen+gick+det+v%C3%A4gen%E2%80%9D&amp;rft.jtitle=%5B%5BAftonbladet%5D%5D&amp;rft.aulast=Jonathan+Nilsson&amp;rft.au=Jonathan+Nilsson&amp;rft.date=28+oktober+2018&amp;rft&#95;id=http